  "metadata": {
    "title": "DeepSeek V4.1 Flash 1017 EXL3 2.9bpw TensorFold TP2 (tonyd2wild)",
    "description": "Tony's native Zig TensorFold TP2 lane at 9fa230d3eb119f588e690bf9b87ce41ed902db60, with the pinned bertholomus engine/kit and the creator's sampling, Triton/indexer and rank-cache patches. Full 1M context, 4 streams, built-in DSpark, image input and byte-checked chat template. Engram shards stay on local NVMe. Read-only source weights derive a per-rank cache and verified RoPE/vision kit under /outputs/cache; restart reuses valid completed work and rebuilds incomplete or malformed derived inputs. The 115 GiB peak estimate follows the creator's 121.7 GiB host with 6.7 GiB free on the head. Upstream measurements are not physical qualification on this fleet.",
